      "cooked": "<p>So this has come up in a number of games both against Warlord Voss and especially Omnitron, so, here it goes:</p>\n<p>If at the end of a turn, a card effect causes another card with an end of turn effect to be returned to play, does the returned card’s end of turn effect also take place?</p>",
