      "id": 23279,
      "name": "TheJayMann",
      "username": "TheJayMann",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-10-12T16:14:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I believe a card returned to play effectively becomes the last card in play order, which will thus always occur after the card that caused the card to come back into play, thus if the former card is acting at the end of turn, the card returned will get to use its end of turn after all other cards.</p>",
