      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/ac8455/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-10-12T18:10:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><em>Shrugging</em> Whenever a card made another card enter play, from the trash or from the deck, we always put it on the far end of a chain and always worked activations from the far end to the near end.</p>",
