      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-10-12T19:26:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Things on cards happen in the order the cards were played.</p>\n<p>So if there are any card effects that bring more cards into play, then the new-est cards were played last, and thus still need to resolve their own effects before the villan turn is completed.</p>",
